{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01DNQWxLSmNF8QnDeYXCPua6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. I wrote **`answers/05-009-perplexity-rouge-bleu-pitfalls-of-n-gram-metrics.md`** — Q9 on the pitfalls of n-gram metrics. Key points covered:\n\n- **Perplexity**: not cross-model comparable (tokenizer differences), blind to factual accuracy — useful only within same model family for checkpoint selection\n- **BLEU**: designed for MT with multiple references; penalises correct paraphrases to near-zero; a chatbot scored 4.2/5 by humans can show BLEU < 0.25\n- **ROUGE**: better for summarization (recall-oriented) but still surface-form; factually correct paraphrase still scores low\n- **Production replacement stack**: RAGAS (Faithfulness + Answer Relevancy), LLM-as-judge on 5–10% sample, golden dataset regression gate, business metrics (deflection rate, CSAT, p95 latency)\n\n14 items remain in Next (Q10–Q23 + validate)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":320,"cache_read_input_tokens":67566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":320,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3bf88f59-d04d-4838-84a2-e126c5cc9360","uuid":"cf367cbb-62c4-4d9b-b472-131ee095a683"}
